      "title_zh": "安全研究员警告 AI 可能在应急响应中主动阻碍防御者并产生无限制的反击行为",
      "title_orig": "Lesson #1: AI can actively block your IR when needed most Probs up next: Defender AI without guardrails will \"hack back\" in one way or another So, thr...",
